WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.300
A white multi-rotor Joby prototype flies low over a dry field, with a line of trees and a hill behind it.

00:07.300 --> 00:14.000
A closer view of the aircraft against a clear blue sky, its rotors spinning.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Another close view against the sky as the aircraft turns.
